WEBVTT

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:03.520
<i>Hey, you guys...</i>

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.430
<i>We wish to go to Hachijo Island.</i>

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:09.010
<i>You're fishermen, right?</i>

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Take us there.</i>

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:37.350
You fool.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:39.070
You can't even watch someone?

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.660
So, Gaikotsu, what was that carriage?

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:48.420
Both the Shrine and Temple 
and the Samurai Patrols

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.910
were guarding it.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:56.050
It was almost certainly the Insect Magistrate!

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:58.630
The Insect Magistrate?

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:03.110
It's a well-kept secret, but every summer,

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:06.620
the Magistrate goes somewhere 
known as the Refuge,

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:08.640
and dwells there alone.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:12.900
But no one knows where it is.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:16.620
Wait... Why didn't you tell me?

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:19.580
If I'd known, I'd have killed her myself.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:22.450
That would be impossible. 
You just run errands.

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:24.890
Don't be stupid.

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:26.960
Murdering the Insect Magistrate

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:30.230
the ultimate goal of the Insect Hunters.

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:31.950
Indeed,

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:37.010
and your failure to do your 
job ruined our chances.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.820
Fine, fine.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:43.010
I'll go find someone at the magistrate's office
 and ask them where the Refuge is.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:46.340
If you don't want to die, don't screw up.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.540
Go, then, insects.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.780
<b>Mitsuki's Honey Trap</b>

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.780
An insect!

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.540
Now to the east!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.290
Another one!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:17.670
Looks like everyone is very busy.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:22.590
Lately, there have been 
way too many insects.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.930
And once they show up, they run.

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.210
What's going on?

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:28.960
I can do this!

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.430
But I'm tired...

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:33.160
What's wrong, everyone?

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:34.880
You look tired!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.320
Let's get back to work!

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:39.740
Jinbei-kun, why don't you rest?

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.140
You're the only one who hasn't 
had a break. Are you okay?

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:44.390
That's right.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.330
The rest of us are working in shifts.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:49.080
What are you saying?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:54.820
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, cannot 
rest while Edo is in danger!

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:56.330
J-Jinbei-kun...

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:57.670
Trouble!

00:03:58.280 --> 00:03:59.710
Now there's an insect in Fukakawa.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.090
Okay, let's go.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:03.840
Jinbei-kun!

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:06.360
You should rest.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.600
I can still fight.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.040
Listen to me.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:12.770
As your superior, this is my order.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:19.690
<i>He will be my target...</i>

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.440
<b>Mikawaya</b>

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:29.970
Is something wrong?

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:32.960
My shoelace broke!

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.530
That's a shame.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:43.000
Thank you!

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:44.480
Not at all.

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:46.480
Goodbye, then.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:47.650
Um...

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.140
Might you be able to help me?

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.820
I seem to have lost my way...

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.510
Oh, I'm sorry to hear that.

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:56.480
Ah, my bra is showing!

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:02.230
I w-will be happy to show you around!

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.900
My name is Mitsuki.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.490
Nice to meet you, Jin-san.

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:14.060
He's a kid and he looks stupid.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.120
He'll be easy prey.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.940
This time, I'll cut you in half.

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:22.640
Another insect nearby.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:27.510
Just a second! 
Once I've finished this one...

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.850
It ran away.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:34.500
So, Mitsuki-dono, where is your inn?

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.300
Hmm...

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:40.260
There are insects over there and there...

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:41.020
Huh?

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.920
Ah, it's nothing!

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:45.240
Maybe there?

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:48.240
Oh! Near Nihonbashi.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:50.630
So that's it...

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:52.990
You're here, in Edo, to find someone?

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:55.500
Yes.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.000
I only want to see them, even once!

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:04.250
How noble!

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:07.740
I'd love to help you!

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:10.760
<i>Men are such fools.</i>

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:14.520
You're a fun person, Mitsuki-dono!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:20.450
Oh, no! Mugai-kun!

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:23.020
Oh, Mugai-dono!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.500
Out of the way!

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.840
These are fresh from the river!

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.910
Jin-san!

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.660
An eel got inside my kimono!

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:35.230
Please get it out!

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:36.410
What?

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:46.170
Someone get those for me!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.250
Mitsuki?

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.790
It's been a while, Mugai-kun.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.760
What are you doing?

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:59.390
Oh, nothing.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.150
I don't know what you're planning,

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:04.230
but you've chosen the wrong one.

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:07.150
The wrong one? That idiot?

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.880
I got it! I got it!

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:09.900
I got it!

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:13.960
<i>What is he talking about?</i>

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:17.040
<i>That boy is already in love with me.</i>

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:18.790
So,

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:21.710
what kind of people work 
at the Insect Magistrate?

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.280
Let's see...

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:26.800
Koikawa Shungiku-dono, 
whose majestic strikes can cleave rock.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.840
Hibachi-dono, with her elegant 
ninjutsu and explosions!

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:34.300
Ichinotani Tenma-dono, 
whose shikigami are invincible!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.160
They're all wonderful.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:39.310
And?

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:42.220
Matsunohara Kotori-dono, our superior.

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:45.740
And there's someone above him, isn't there?

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:47.400
Above him?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.900
Like your leader...

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.910
The person at the top...

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:58.200
Oh, you mean them?

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:00.670
Hello, Jinbei-sama.

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:02.920
Oh, Oharu-dono!

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.500
<i>Wh-What?</i>

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.410
<i>Who is this giant peach woman?</i>

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:10.480
Are you not working today?

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:11.420
That's right!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:15.430
I was fine, but Kotori-dono ordered it.

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:18.970
<i>And I think he's forgotten about me!</i>

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.350
<i>Just when it was getting good, too!</i>

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.100
Jin-san!

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.560
We're going over there, Jin-san!

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:29.530
Are you okay, Oharu-dono!

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:32.280
What?

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.530
Ow...

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:36.400
I tripped and spilled my water...

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:38.630
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:41.540
<i>This will wreck everything 
I've accomplished today!</i>

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.460
<i>I have to do something.</i>

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:45.850
<i>There!</i>

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:49.340
Oharu-dono, please dry yourself with this.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.440
I couldn't...

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:52.800
Your kimono will get wet.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:59.300
Jin-san! I tripped, as well!

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:01.460
Are you okay?

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:02.610
Thank you.

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.050
<i>Giant peach woman!</i>

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.210
Did you also get wet, Mitsuki-dono?

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.230
Then I'll take off this fundoshi.

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.360
What is wrong with him?!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.620
Why does the giant peach 
woman get his kimono,

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:19.070
while I get his underwear?

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:23.200
I'm done with the honey trap.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:27.260
I'll use that stupid peach woman...

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:30.710
Oharu,

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:32.940
close up the shop.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.090
Okay.

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:42.520
What's wrong, Oharu?

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:44.980
Oharu?

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:47.220
Oharu?

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:56.720
Tsukishima, you rested yesterday, 
so you'd better work hard today.

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:58.670
Good luck, kid.

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:01.030
Right, leave it to me!

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:04.730
Is something wrong?

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:08.000
Oharu-chan went missing last night.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:09.630
What?

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:11.630
Oharu-dono is missing?

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:14.010
Jin-san!

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:14.880
Mitsuki-dono...

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.820
I have something important 
to ask you today...

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:22.250
I'm sorry, but I can't 
help you right now.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.940
That's what Oharu-dono 
was wearing yesterday!

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:27.720
Yup.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:29.590
Do I look good in it?

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.750
Yes, you look very good.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:36.060
That isn't the point!

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:38.510
I kidnapped that giant peach woman!

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:47.600
Come alone to Miyamamura, north of town.

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:48.690
Otherwise,

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:53.880
my insects will devour

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:56.040
that peach woman.

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:01.890
There it is.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.480
Let's go, Tsukishima.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:06.240
Eh? Where's Tsukishima?

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.890
He's gone...

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.170
Where am I?

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:20.150
You're awake?

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:26.540
You're going to be a hostage, 
to lure Tsukishima Jinbei.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:29.880
Why?

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:32.680
I have no reason to tell you.

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:40.110
This space belongs to me alone.

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:42.340
What happened to those who lived here?

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:44.800
It doesn't need any occupants.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:48.210
Humans are annoying, 
and you can't trust them.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:51.300
Aren't you lonely?

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:52.750
Lonely?

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.940
Living here alone would be too lonely for me.

00:11:57.990 --> 00:12:01.290
I think it's fun in the city

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:03.460
because you can see everyone smiling.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:04.950
Shut up!

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:08.020
What do you know?

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:13.560
Miyamamura should be here somewhere.

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:15.050
But there's nothing...

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:18.960
Where are you? Mitsuki-dono?

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.790
Oharu-dono!

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:23.720
Jeez, you're both obnoxious.

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:27.070
Mitsuki-dono, where is Oharu-dono?

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.610
If you want to find out,

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:32.980
then tell me where your leader, 
the Insect Magistrate, is.

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:35.240
Tell me!

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:41.030
Mitsuki-dono, I do want to tell you something.

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:43.390
What you are doing is wrong!

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:50.080
You may not realize it, but what 
you're doing here is very bad!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.070
You should stop this right now!

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:57.280
It's true that I upset you while I was escorting you yesterday, but－

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:56.320
<i>What? Is he actually lecturing me?</i>

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:58.620
Shut up! Shut up!

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:02.000
Just tell me where the Insect 
Magistrate's Refuge is!

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:04.210
Mitsuki-dono...

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:09.600
I have never even met the Insect Magistrate.

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:12.810
I'm sorry!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:18.130
I'm still new, so I don't know where 
the magistrate lives or might go!

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:19.840
Don't lie to me!

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:20.950
I'm not.

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:23.790
But I will go ask Kotori-dono.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:24.970
Please wait here!

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:29.460
So you'll keep me here while you 
get the rest of your friends?

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:30.970
I won't allow that.

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:37.890
What is this?

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:41.030
An insect?

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:55.990
You're a really stupid samurai, aren't you?

00:13:59.740 --> 00:14:00.970
Mitsuki-dono...

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:02.070
Oharu-dono!

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:04.020
Jinbei-sama!

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:08.990
I was an idiot for thinking of trying 
to use someone as stupid as you.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.340
Jinbei-sama isn't stupid.

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:16.110
He's strong and kind and caring...

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:17.500
He's a wonderful samurai.

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:21.000
Leave it to me, Oharu-dono!

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:24.790
You think all you have to do
 is have faith and you'll be saved?

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:28.200
That never happens!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.740
<i>This is my chance.</i>

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:40.980
<i>I can help Jinbei-sama, too!</i>

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:47.360
<i>I c-can't reach...</i>

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:50.360
Jinbei-sama!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.760
Oharu-dono!

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.500
Are you okay, Oharu-dono?

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.750
Thank you very much, Jinbei-sama.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.260
I won't let you escape.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.760
Oharu-dono, watch out!

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:23.970
Sinking sand below, 
and buildings falling from above!

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:25.730
There's nowhere to run...

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:30.850
Don't worry.

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:32.740
I had a great idea.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:37.040
We'll climb those falling buildings 
to the hole on the roof!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.250
<b>Goal</b>

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.260
Yay, yay!

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:41.310
J-Jinbei-sama...

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:45.500
What a wonderful idea!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.680
Let's go!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:47.500
Yes.

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:50.510
Looks like you want to get squashed.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:53.610
Oharu-dono, first grab on to my hips!

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:54.220
Right.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:56.430
Forward!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:58.580
To my back!

00:15:58.580 --> 00:15:59.970
Jump on my head!

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:00.310
Right!

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:01.810
What?

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.900
N-No way.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:08.010
They're seriously planning to try for the exit?

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.400
Now jump on my shoulders!

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:19.510
Mitsuki-dono...

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:21.370
I know something!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.210
I know how nice you are.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.420
You're so nice,

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.620
you would never do anything like this!

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:31.560
H-How dumb can you be?

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:34.930
After all this, he still trusts me?

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.340
I understand...

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:40.140
You're being threatened by someone!

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:41.430
Were you?

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:43.940
So you can have faith in me.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.190
I'll protect you!

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:45.190
<i>What is this?</i>

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:49.940
What the hell is wrong with those two?!

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:00.510
What is that?

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:02.300
All the different insects...

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.870
They all flew off at once?

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:15.380
The exit is so close, but insects are everywhere
 and no more buildings are falling!

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:18.390
<i>Idiot... I won't drop any more.</i>

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:29.600
Look at that.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:31.490
No matter what you say,

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:34.740
if you believe in that idiot, 
this is what happens!

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:45.060
Oharu-dono, are you safe?

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:46.290
Yes.

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:49.790
This is why you can't lower your guard...

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:53.300
Yes, let's be more careful next time.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.340
Right!

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:57.810
<i>They're laughing...</i>

00:17:57.810 --> 00:17:59.800
<i>What are they laughing at?</i>

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:03.560
<i>I think it's fun in the city</i>

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.810
<i>because you can see everyone smiling.</i>

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:22.840
Always be ready for a fight!

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:27.600
Let's make it out this time.

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.420
Yes, Jinbei-sama.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.990
Don't think it's over yet.

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:33.480
I still have more...

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:38.130
insects to call!

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:40.590
You're going to die here!

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:49.230
I found you, insects!

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:50.600
Guys!

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:00.610
<i>Repentance Slash.</i>

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:01.870
<i>Hydrangea Blossoms.</i>

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:05.000
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.230
I finally got to kill you...

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:13.210
Yes, I feel better.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:17.060
I wondered why they were all 
converging in one place.

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:18.380
Everyone,

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:20.840
good work!

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:23.350
You...

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:25.140
What are you doing here?

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:28.580
Jinbei-sama, Mitsuki-san is gone.

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:31.830
Mitsuki-dono...

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:40.900
Mugai-kun, that Tsukishima guy 
doesn't know anything, does he?

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:45.160
You were right. 
I picked the wrong guy.

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:49.120
That wasn't what I meant.

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:51.170
Then, what did you mean?

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:59.200
I'm not sure I know myself.

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:06.230
Even I don't understand that idiot!

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:14.960
Tsukishima Jinbei?

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:16.490
I'll remember that name.

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:26.000
Hey, you guys...

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:30.220
We wish to go to Hachijo Island.

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:31.650
You're fishermen, right?

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:34.210
Take us there.

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:37.410
There's nothing on that island.

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.640
What would you want there?

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:43.930
No, we're told there's a girl hiding there.

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:59.820
Gaikotsu, is leaving Mitsuki here all right?

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:02.950
We don't need that useless girl anymore.

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:05.820
When we're back from the island, I'll kill her.

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:08.580
Very well.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.040
Let's go, men...

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.710
It's time for revenge!

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:03.070
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.130 --> 00:23:01.530
Let's go to Hachijo Island!

00:23:01.530 --> 00:23:02.470
Good luck.

00:23:02.470 --> 00:23:04.530
Supposedly, the island has two big mountains.

00:23:04.530 --> 00:23:05.500
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:23:05.500 --> 00:23:07.860
What? There they are!

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:09.950
I knew that was going to happen!

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:11.660
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:12.880
The Insect Hunters Attack.

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>The Insect Hunters Attack!! 
Battle of Hachijo Island!!</b>

00:23:12.880 --> 00:23:14.000
Battle of Hachijo Island.
